# D3-MI-005: Carbonate and sulfate minerals do not share the same acid-test signal
# Simulation candidate; no runtime observations are claimed.
register lv3
new
add v1 water 40mL
add v1 CaCO3 0.0005mol
add v2 water 40mL
add v2 gypsum 0.0005mol
seal v1 500mL
seal v2 500mL
add v1 HCl 0.0012mol
add v2 HCl 0.0012mol
measure v1 pressure
measure v2 pressure
look v1
look v2
particles v1
particles v2
inspect
